Package: oxvif
Version: @CLI_VERSION@-1
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: oxvif maintainers <smiti1642@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/smiti1642/oxvif
Description: Human- and Agent-friendly ONVIF diagnostic CLI
 oxvif provides read-only device diagnostics, discovery, inventory, fleet
 execution, schema-versioned JSON, private-CA support, and native credential
 storage without a plaintext fallback.
